   "id": "t-1155",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Neutral layer: Iceberg in S3 + one REST catalog (Open Catalog/Polaris \u00b7 UC) \u2014 both engines read shared data\nno efficient cross-read of Snowflake native tables \u2014 running both = two contracts, two governance models, two teams",
   "originalText": "Neutral layer: Iceberg in S3 + one REST catalog (Open Catalog/Polaris \u00b7 UC) \u2014 both engines read shared data\nno efficient cross-read of Snowflake native tables \u2014 running both = two contracts, two governance models, two teams",
